                                "box": {
                                    "code": "scaled = (in1 * 255);\r\n\r\ninbit1 = (((scaled / in2) % 2) > 1);\r\ninbit2 = (((scaled / in3) % 2) > 1);\r\ninbit3 = (((scaled / in4) % 2) > 1);\r\ninbit4 = (((scaled / in5) % 2) > 1);\r\ninbit5 = (((scaled / in6) % 2) > 1);\r\ninbit6 = (((scaled / in7) % 2) > 1);\r\ninbit7 = (((scaled / in8) % 2) > 1);\r\ninbit8 = (((scaled / in9) % 2) > 1);\r\n\r\nbit1 = inbit1 * in2;\r\nbit2 = inbit2 * in3;\r\nbit3 = inbit3 * in4;\r\nbit4 = inbit4 * in5;\r\nbit5 = inbit5 * in6;\r\nbit6 = inbit6 * in7;\r\nbit7 = inbit7 * in8;\r\nbit8 = inbit8 * in9;\r\n\r\n\r\nout1 = ((bit1 + bit2 + bit3 + bit4 + bit5 + bit6 + bit7 + bit8) / 256);",
